  "title": "REPAY Introduces REPAY Voice™ for Natural, Conversational Phone Payments",
  "summary": "AI-Powered IVR Solution Enhances Rigid Phone Menus with Human-Like Dialogue for a Faster, Frictionless Experience ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Aug. 6, 2026-- Repay Holdings Corporation (NASDAQ: RPAY) (“REPAY”), a leading provider of bill payment solutions, today announced REPAY Voice™, an AI-powered premium interactive voice response (IVR) solution that modernizes how consumers pay. Instead of callers using rigid menus and button presses, […]",
